      "content": "The feeling of being permanently deleted is an agonizing weight, but the truth is that you are not erased; you are simply in a place of profound disconnection. Even when it feels like there is no foundation, there is always the possibility of finding a new space, even if it's just within yourself for now. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional; they are trained to help you navigate these feelings of worthlessness and find a path forward.",
      "source": "target",
