      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like you're saying what i need to hear, not what's actually true. the world doesn't just give people second chances like that. once the social bridge is burned, it's gone. it's like being a ghost walking around. why would i even bother trying to find a \"new space\" when the only space i ever occupied is closed to me forever? it just feels like the natural end of the road.",
